<title>COLOMBIA: Colombian peso ends down against dollar.</title>
<headline>Colombian peso ends down against dollar.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colombia's peso closed down 80 centavos at 1,107.20 against the dollar, interbank dealers said.</p>
<p>&quot;The market was quiet all day,&quot; a trader said. &quot;The banks are squaring their books for the end of the month and we don't expect any major movements in the next few days.&quot;</p>
<p>Dealers reported 296 trades worth $165 million. The peso opened at 1,107.20, and traded between an intraday high of 1,106.05 and a low of 1,107.35.</p>
<p>((-- Nelson Bocanegra, Bogota newsroom, 571 610 7944))</p>
